Package: tidyonnx
Title: Native ONNX Tree Ensemble Serialization and Inference
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("João B. G.", "de Brito", email = "joao@sabby.com.br",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts numerical XGBoost tree ensembles to the Open Neural
    Network Exchange format and evaluates supported ONNX tree graphs through
    a self-contained C engine. Provides S7 model objects, automatic session
    restoration, and predictable tibble predictions using a cpp11 bridge.
    Integrates fitted parsnip models and modeling workflows through post-fit
    conversion while retaining their prediction preprocessing. Includes Protocol
    Buffers sources for offline installation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/JoaoSabby/tidyonnx
BugReports: https://github.com/JoaoSabby/tidyonnx/issues
